6240..6316 Comment "/// Function extensionality from a homotopy, through the path space: the map"
6317..6391 Comment "/// takes a point to both functions\' results there and the homotopy\'s path"
6392..6468 Comment "/// between them. Its first end reads the first result, a returned call, and"
6469..6543 Comment "/// a returned call is the call it holds, so the end is `f`; the second is"
6544..6552 Comment "/// `g`."
